  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 3, ODRL Rule Relationships: a Policy holds one or more Permissions, one or more Prohibitions and one or more obligations. A Permission has a duty to one or more Duties, which may have a consequence to further Duties. A Prohibition has a remedy to one or more Duties. An obligation is a Duty, with its own consequence Duties.",
